Either Indigo Group or the Company may terminate this engagement before its expiry by written notice for any of the following reasons:

• A material breach of the terms of this engagement that cannot be remedied;

• A breach that can be remedied but remains unresolved 14 days after notice of the breach;

• A law, judicial order or governmental decree that makes this engagement illegal; or

• Bankruptcy, liquidation, dissolution or an equivalent legal event affecting either party.

In the event of termination, the party giving notice remains entitled to pursue any available legal or contractual remedies.

